;;; Commentary:

;; A sound input method for Pirzath Carved, Pirzath Hand, Pirzath Hand Lifted.
;; Generated by tools/keyboards.py. Put this directory on `load-path',
;; evaluate (require 'heroiclands-pirzath), then M-x set-input-method.

;;; Code:

(require 'quail)

(quail-define-package
 "heroiclands-pirzath" "Pirzath" "HL-Pir" t
 "Type Pirzath Carved, Pirzath Hand, Pirzath Hand Lifted by sound, with the same keys as the HL Pirzath layout.
Each key types its sound in the script, and a key whose sound the script
does not write types nothing. Option has no Emacs key: Option+x is \\ and
then the key that x types, so Option+t (th) is \\t and Option+Shift+t (Th) is \\T.
The cheatsheet keyboards/index.md lists every key."
 nil t nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil t)

